        "title": "Show read-only Codex reset credit inventory",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- Show every still-available Codex reset credit in the menu and provider settings, including credits with no expiry.\n- Keep app refreshes account-scoped and best-effort: one supplemental inventory `GET` per successful Codex account refresh; the CLI requests inventory only when optional credits are explicitly included.\n- Keep the supplemental path strictly read-only: it never refreshes OAuth credentials, sends a `POST`, redeems a credit, or exposes a consume action. Stale credentials skip the optional inventory request.\n- Hash provider credit IDs before they enter app models, persistence, notifications, or logs.\n- Keep nearing-expiry notifications behind the existing optional credits setting while leaving inventory visible.\n- Preserve standard submenu routing on macOS 14.0-14.3 and native subtitles on macOS 14.4+.\n\nRelated to https://github.com/steipete/CodexBar/issues/1502. This intentionally does not close the issue because consuming a reset credit remains out of scope.\n\n## Validation\n\n- exact head: `739e742edf1368d497f72280c3970633c9415385`\n- focused reset-credit/OAuth/CLI/menu coverage: 102 tests in 8 suites passed\n- full `make test`: 46/46 shards passed\n- `make check`: passed; SwiftFormat clean and SwiftLint 0 violations across 1,261 files\n- final autoreview: clean, no accepted/actionable findings; patch correct at 0.86 confidence\n- current `origin/main` is an ancestor; merge simulation is conflict-free\n- exact-head GitHub CI: running\n- built-app proof: final Developer ID build and isolated live launch in progress\n\n## Existing contributor UI proof\n\n<img width=\"564\" height=\"841\" alt=\"Codex reset credits menu\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/332df578-abf5-4733-9bfa-7fe91d4cfad8\" />\n\n<img width=\"904\" height=\"862\" alt=\"Codex reset credits settings\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b92abbfc-84f5-4b2d-bb02-18c459f58748\" />\n\nThanks @brahimhamichan for the original re